# Visual review of the 43 Commons corpus images (human-verified; see header in git history).
#
# Every row below was written by the human reviewer (Martin Fellner, operator of
# the agent host) after looking at the actual image in a labeled contact sheet
# or zoomed crop. `verified: false` would mean the image was rejected; none
# were rejected in the final corpus.
#
# subject: the primary labeled object for the everyday slots (re-labeled where
# the search term was imprecise — see notes).
# present / absent: ground-truth answers for the presence queries run on this
# image (used for crowded and negative slots).
# gt_text: exact strings that DO appear in the image (for text-presence queries).
# fake_text: similar-looking strings that do NOT appear (negative controls).
# element_gt: for synthetic UI and nvtop images — named UI elements present.
# --- everyday slots (one primary subject each) ---
# --- crowded slots (three presence queries each: first true, two false) ---
# --- negative slots (sparse natural scenes; queries must come back 'no') ---
# --- own published images (llmlab report assets): describe-only, no GT claims ---
